<title>GREECE: TABLE-GREEK/BUND GAP NARROWS TO 400BPS, 303 VS BT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-GREEK/BUND GAP NARROWS TO 400BPS, 303 VS BT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond</p>
<p>over bunds shrank to 400 basis points on Friday from Thursday's</p>
<p>405.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also narrowed to 303 basis points from 312</p>
<p>on Thursday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.54%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.00%   04JUL07    5.54%	400	405 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.50%   25APR07    5.45%	409	413 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.51%	303	312 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.26%	328	333 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.18%	336	342 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.04%	250	252 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.11%	343	339 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 0915</p>
<p>GMT.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
